---
// "Who it's for," as two self-qualifying cards: a portfolio path (fully funded)
// and a single-property path (still risk-reversed). Lets the reader place
// themselves in two seconds.
---

<section class="section who" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-title">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="who__head reveal">
      <h2 class="who__title" id="who-title">Find the version that fits you.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="who__cards">
      <article class="who__card who__card--lead reveal">
        <p class="who__tag">Portfolio operators</p>
        <p class="who__count">10+ properties</p>
        <p class="who__copy">
          We pay for the diagnosis out of our own pocket and fund the entire
          pilot. Roughly ten comparable properties for a demonstration, twenty
          or more for a full build. The risk of finding out is entirely ours.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="who__card reveal" style="--i: 1">
        <p class="who__tag">Single property</p>
        <p class="who__count">One building</p>
        <p class="who__copy">
          We still build you a risk-reversed pilot. The structure looks a
          little different, but the principle holds: you see a verified number
          at your meter before you commit to the project.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="who__foot reveal">
      Tell us what you've got and we'll point you to the version that fits.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .who { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .who__title { font-size: var(--step-2); max-width: 20ch; }

  .who__cards {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .who__cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .who__card {
    padding: clamp(1.3rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012);
  }
  .who__card--lead {
    border-color: rgba(194, 163, 104, 0.4);
    background: var(--gold-soft);
  }
  .who__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-text);
  }
  .who__count {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .who__copy {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--body);
  }
  .who__foot {
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
